{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>憑藉逆天長腿及甜美笑容俘虜大批粉絲的劉穎鏇，前日（21日）現身昂坪市集與粉絲見面兼大晒高超籃球技巧。正值事業衝 …</p><p></p>\n<p>憑藉逆天長腿及甜美笑容俘虜大批粉絲的劉穎鏇，前日（21日）現身昂坪市集與粉絲見面兼大晒高超籃球技巧。正值事業衝刺期的她罕有大方公開另一半必備條件，更毫不避忌親自點名完美男拍檔人選。這位新一代宅男女神突然拋出震撼彈，立刻引爆全網熱議。</p>\n<h2>延續《903AllStar籃球賽》強勢展神技</h2>\n<p>挾著早前參與《903 AllStar籃球賽》引起極大迴響強勁氣勢，劉穎鏇出席行山基地見面會時吸引大批群眾圍觀支持。她為答謝粉絲特意化身成專屬教練，即席示範極具難度單手轉波技巧，整個動作流暢無比更維持超過20秒，引發現場觀眾連連驚呼。其後她更邀請數位幸運兒上台大玩左右手拍波遊戲，氣氛推至頂峰，活動尾聲親自送上簽名波衫兼大方合照冧爆全場。</p>\n<h2>強勢點名張振朗合作全新籃球劇</h2>\n<p>早前在台慶夜大騷結實肌肉線條與「鉸剪腳」動作震撼觀眾，劉穎鏇受訪時坦言做演員應該多方面嘗試，不想被局限於單一戲路。適逢電視台宣布12月將有5部新劇開機，她趁機向監製自薦渴望拍攝籃球題材作品，揚言「如果可以將興趣融入拍劇，玩住籃球咁開工一定好開心！」被問及心水男主角人選時，她毫不猶豫直接點名張振朗，大讚對方是藝員籃球隊中首選拍檔。</p>\n<h2>罕有公開擇偶條件偏好運動型男</h2>\n<p>身為備受矚目人氣花旦，劉穎鏇感情生活一直備受外界高度關注。她毫不吝嗇大談未來男友標準，直指運動型男生最具吸引力，更強調「如果另一半同樣鍾意打籃球同行山，絕對係雙重加分！有共同興趣先可以行得更遠。」她幻想能與未來伴侶一邊行山一邊欣賞日落，直言那種陪伴感覺充滿粉紅泡泡。不過她隨即重申目前正值事業衝刺期，暫時沒有結婚計畫，霸氣叫追求者「俾啲耐性」。</p>\n<h2>網民高度評價專業態度期待新作</h2>\n<p>劉穎鏇點名宣言一出，隨即在各大討論區引發熱烈討論。大批粉絲對於這對嶄新螢幕情侶組合表示極度期待，紛紛留言大讚「長腿女神配型男真係好有火花」、「好想睇佢哋喺籃球場上強強對決」。同時亦有不少網民欣賞她對事業那份專注與拼搏精神，直指「劉穎鏇真係好專業，連轉波都練到咁完美」、「事業心重女仔特別吸引」，討論區內充斥大量看好她未來強勢發展留言。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542469851630319_2265013246b0401baec371.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6062203187504027440.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542469851630319_2265013246b0401baec371.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542469962027675_11515482676b0401bbecbd5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6062203187504027442.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542469962027675_11515482676b0401bbecbd5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542470092129048_10201305026b0401bd55520.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6062203187504027444.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542470092129048_10201305026b0401bd55520.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795424702031575_1121990206b0401bead561.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6062203187504027443.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795424702031575_1121990206b0401bead561.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542470403225015_18192070786b0401c0711ef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6062203187504027441.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542470403225015_18192070786b0401c0711ef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8a%89%e7%a9%8e%e9%8f%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">劉穎鏇</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e6%8c%af%e6%9c%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張振朗</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b1%83%e7%90%83%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">籃球女神</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3548749\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 23 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T10:43:56.927355+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1290,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:05:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T10:57:04.941895+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T10:37:32.224416+00:00","content_hash":"796490cef26bf78ad39dc89ac7f31263df1df6e3d7694fcb1145f467518dabee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}